  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien ska in the fast two-tone style. Off-beat clean electric guitar skank on every upbeat; a trumpet and trombone section playing unison riffs and stabs; a walking bass line with a woody upright-style tone; organ bubble on the off-beats; tight fast drums with snare fills into each chorus. Live-room sound, horns bright and up front, bass punchy, a short horn break in the bridge. A gravelly male lead, half-sung and grinning, with a rowdy banquet crowd shouting the hook back. 168 BPM, Bb major. Rowdy, bouncing and laughing. No reggaeton beat, no autotune, no trap drums, no EDM drop, no slow ballad section.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n里民運動會 拔索比賽\n巷頭對巷尾 二十年的冤家\n阿伯徛頭前 褲帶縛予絚\n阿姆佇後壁 喝甲喉嚨破\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n裁判的笛仔 嗶一聲\n規條索仔 繃甲直直\n\n[Chorus]\n拔啊 拔啊 用力拔\n巷頭的 毋通輸\n跤踏予在 腰向落去\n一 二 拔 一 二 拔\n\n[Verse]\n第一場 阮巷頭贏\n第二場 巷尾的贏轉去\n賣肉圓的 手骨上粗\n王老師 手套穿兩雙\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n決賽開始 厝邊頭尾\n攏徛佇邊仔 咧喝\n\n[Chorus]\n拔啊 拔啊 用力拔\n巷尾的 嘛毋通輸\n阿伯的假喙齒 險險落落來\n一 二 拔 一 二 拔\n\n[Bridge]\n索仔 煞斷去\n兩爿的人 攏坐落塗跤\n規場 笑甲徛袂起來\n\n[Chorus]\n拔啊 拔啊 莫閣拔\n今年算 平手就好\n索仔斷去 冤家嘛斷去\n做伙去食 肉圓\n\n[Outro]\n明年閣拔 索仔愛買較粗的",
